<title>USA: TABLE - Essex Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Essex Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.15     loss	 $0.14</p>
<p> Net loss		     527     loss	   516</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,600		    3,600</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.27   profit	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net loss		     986   profit	   554</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,600		    3,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 1997 results from continuing operations loss $393,000 on revenues of $891,000 vs loss $613,000 on revenues of $1.0 million. First-half 1997 continuing operations loss $885,000 on revenues $2.1 million vs profit $176,000 on revenues $2.1 million.</p>
<p>First-half 1996 results include $1.7 million gain from lawsuit settlement.</p>
<p>Revenues figures above exclude discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Essex Corp.</p>
